    "cpu_formulas_observed": "BP_GlobalGI.UpdateCharacterGI (Kismet bytecode): c = CustomCharacterLightingIntensity; Ambient = lerp(BackSide, CharacterAmbientColor, c); MainLight = lerp(FrontSide, CharacterMainLightColor, c); Rim = lerp(MainLightTint*MainLightIntensity, CharacterRimColor, c); SSS = lerp(1, CharacterSSSIntensity, c); RimDir = (EulerToForward(pitch 30, yaw lerp(sceneLightYaw, LightHorizontalAngle, c)), 0). Every preset below has c = 1, so its DA values pass straight through.",
    "AmbientParamsPartial": "Used instead of AmbientParams when the asset defines only some of the three components (keys x, y, z).",
    "omitted": "AOStrength (View[286].z), DepthGradient, RimWidthScale (r.ToonRimWidthFactor), RimTint (cb0[1]): no value recoverable offline. Fields an asset does not override are omitted; their runtime value comes from lower TOD layers or native C++ defaults (Unknown).",
